Our new Fart Simulator 2018 update HotSeat 2.0 will return you to the world of fierce confrontation and rivalry in the best traditions of old eSport. You can have fun with your friends playing for the victory! No "Battle Royale" and lootboxes – only the mastery of hands, sharp mind and a small amount of luck!

The key features:

- The multiplayer game technology HotSeat 2.0:

The modern technology has allowed to realize the possibility of 3 players game using one keyboard (or gamepads) in real time! HotSeat 1.0 and its turn-based battles are over. Invite your friends to your home, treat them with tea and play the collective mode HotSeat 2.0! It will be fun!

- Incredible and diverse arenas for battles:

Who would have thought that in the Fart Simulator 2018 HotSeat 2.0 you will enjoy fantastic views, fighting with friends! Climb to the roof of a tall house, jump inside the active volcano, visit the decaying underground base, and also take on an endlessly long trip on an elevator!

- Ruthless weapons and amazing modes;

The whole arsenal of crazy weapons from the main mode Fart Simulator 2018 waits you in HotSeat 2.0! In addition to the classic Deathmatch mode, you will have a new mode that has come to us from little known multiplayer shooters with no future - "Murder with one small puff of fart".

List of updates:

Added a mode against each other, which includes:

- 4 cards with unique features;

- Bot support;

- Keyboard and gamepads management;

- 2 game modes;

- Different awards for joint play;

- Colorful animations and graphics.
